// matras: the app's identity in one place (base configuration of the project; every target, the
// app group of the app and its extensions and the keychain group derive from it).
// The Matras id is ru.toxblh.matras (push prefix apple_matras, see app/utils/push_platform). It
// needs its App ID, the extensions' ids and group.ru.toxblh.matras in the owner's Apple account
// (docs/credentials-setup.md); until then the app keeps Mattermost's beta id.
MATRAS_BUNDLE_ID = com.mattermost.rnbeta
MATRAS_APP_GROUP = group.$(MATRAS_BUNDLE_ID)

// The Apple Developer Team that signs the app and its extensions (every target's
// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM). Empty in the repository: simulator builds need none. For a device build put
// `MATRAS_TEAM_ID = <your team id>` into ios/Matras.local.xcconfig (not committed).
MATRAS_TEAM_ID =
#include? "Matras.local.xcconfig"
